title: Funk in E with a Bridge
key: E
tempo: 106
style: funk

// A verse that sits on the one, a chorus on the four, and a bridge that
// climbs back to the five.
[Verse]
|: E9 | % | % | A9 :|

[Chorus]
| A9 | % | E9 | %    |
| A9 | % | B9 | B7#9 |

[Bridge]
| C#m7 | F#9 | C#m7   | F#9 |
| A13  | %   | B9sus4 | B9  |
